00:21:05.371 --> 00:21:08.788
Berry style identified one of those
steps in research on banks.

00:21:09.038 --> 00:21:13.288
It's very common for banks to loan
money and to and to lose money.

00:21:13.621 --> 00:21:16.996
Banks fall victim to escalation of
commitment when they keep expecting

00:21:16.996 --> 00:21:20.579
people who have defaulted on loan payments
to come through instead of

00:21:20.579 --> 00:21:22.163
writing them off as uncollectable,

00:21:22.871 --> 00:21:25.413
Barry and his colleagues analyzed
data from nearly all

00:21:25.413 --> 00:21:27.538
the banks in California over nine years.

